COMICCRAFT – DESIGN PHASEFolder: 3. Design PhaseProject:ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini ModelsDocuments:1. ComicCraft_System_Architecture.docx2. ComicCraft_UI_UX_Design.docx3. ComicCraft_Database_Design.docx4. ComicCraft_API_Design.docx5. ComicCraft_AI_Model_Design.docxPurpose:This folder contains the design documentation of the ComicCraft AI Comic Story Creator project.The Design Phase covers:• System Architecture• UI/UX Design• Database Design• API Design• AI Model DesignThe documents describe the overall system structure, user interface, data organization, backend API communication, and AI-based comic generation workflow.